== which rows have a link ======================================
ok   a buffer that never had a link: no row may link
ok   the linked row may link
ok   the row above does not
ok   the row below does not
ok   scrolled up by two: the link is in row 3
ok   a copy keeps it
ok   scrolled down by three in place: the link is in row 8
ok   clear: no row may link
ok   full: the link adds only its own bytes (open before the cell, close after the cell)

